This directory is an independent service that talks to Chatwoot only through
its public Agent Bot webhook and REST API. It contains no code from
Chatwoot's enterprise/ directory.

Third-party code
----------------
None yet. Phase 2 (this MVP) is written from scratch using only the Go
standard library.

When code is adapted from huabeitech/agent-desk (Apache License 2.0,
https://github.com/huabeitech/agent-desk) or ideas/code from raksbisht/sitechat
(MIT, https://github.com/raksbisht/sitechat), list each adapted file here as:

  <our file>  <-  <upstream repo>@<commit>:<upstream file>  (<license>)

and keep the upstream copyright notice in the file header.
